<title>UK: Lehman Brothers sets $250 mln five-year FRN.</title>
<headline>Lehman Brothers sets $250 mln five-year FRN.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-08-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following floating-rate issue was announced by lead manager Lehman Brothers International.</p>
<p> BORROWER   LEHMAN BROTHERS HOLDING PLC</p>
<p> AMT	  $250 MLN  BASE	 3M-LIBOR  MATURITY    03.SEP.02</p>
<p> TYPE	 FRN	 MARGIN     +30 BP    PAY DATE    03.SEP.97</p>
<p> MOODY	BAA1	ISS PRICE  99.785    FULL FEES   0.35</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  A	   REOFFER    99.785</p>
<p> LISTING    LONDON    DENOMS (K) 100	 SALE LIMITS US/UK</p>
<p> NEG PLG    YES	 CRS DEFLT  NO	  FORCE MAJ   IPMA 2</p>
<p> GOV LAW    NEW YORK  HOME CTRY  U.S.	TAX PROVS   STANDARD</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.15	SELL CONC  0.20	PRAECIPUUM  NONE</p>
<p> NOTES	LEHMAN BROTHERS</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 8863</p>
</text>
